---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/ai.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Prometheus - Hardware - Rycode"
  description="Meta's New Albany, Ohio data center: over 1 GW of compute capacity for the Prometheus AI cluster."
  variant="ai"
>
  <article class="ai-model">
    <p class="ai-model-kicker">Hardware · Data center</p>
    <h1 class="ai-model-title">Prometheus</h1>
    <p class="ai-model-dek">Prometheus is Meta's AI cluster at its New Albany data center in Ohio, Meta's first in the state. Meta says the site delivers over 1 GW of compute capacity to house Prometheus (<a href="https://datacenters.atmeta.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Meta_s-New-Albany-Data-Center.pdf">Meta, New Albany fact sheet, Sep 2026</a>).</p>
    <hr class="ai-model-rule" />

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Key figures</h2>
    <div class="ai-model-table-wrap">
      <table class="ai-model-table ai-model-table--prose">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Figure</th><th scope="col">New Albany data center</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Compute capacity</td><td>Over 1 GW</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Investment</td><td>$1.5 billion+</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Ground broken</td><td>2017</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Jobs once running</td><td>300+</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Trade workers at peak</td><td>1,200</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p>A gigawatt (GW) is a billion watts, about the output of one large power plant; a megawatt (MW) is a thousandth of that. Data centers are sized by the power they can draw.</p>
    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Power</h2>
    <p>Meta says it worked with AEP (American Electric Power) to pay the full cost of the site's energy, and supports five Ohio projects adding 847 MW of new clean and renewable energy. Meta's January 2026 nuclear deals deliver power to the grids that serve Prometheus (<a href="https://about.fb.com/news/2026/01/meta-nuclear-energy-projects-power-american-ai-leadership/">Meta, 9 Jan 2026</a>); see <a href="/ai/hardware/power/meta-nuclear/">Meta nuclear package</a>.</p>
    <h2 class="ai-model-section">What is not public</h2>
    <p>Meta's fact sheet does not give a chip count or chip type for Prometheus.</p>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Sources</h2>
    <ul class="ai-model-sources">
      <li><a href="https://datacenters.atmeta.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Meta_s-New-Albany-Data-Center.pdf">Meta, New Albany Data Center fact sheet (Sep 2026)</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://about.fb.com/news/2026/01/meta-nuclear-energy-projects-power-american-ai-leadership/">Meta, nuclear energy projects (9 Jan 2026)</a></li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</Layout>
